{"tier":"glm-5.3-flash","verse":12,"ref":"proverbs 24:12","book":"proverbs","lang":"en4","chapter":24,"translation":"If you say, See, we did not know this — does not he who weighs hearts, is it not he who understands? and he who keeps your soul, he will know? and he will return to a man according to his work.","tokens":[{"surface":"כי","gloss":"if"},{"surface":"תאמר","gloss":"you say"},{"surface":"הן","gloss":"See"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"ידענו","gloss":"we knew"},{"surface":"זה","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"הלא","gloss":"does not","readings":["does not","is it not that not"]},{"surface":"תכן","gloss":"he who weighs","readings":["he who weighs","he who measures out"]},{"surface":"לבות","gloss":"hearts"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"he"},{"surface":"יבין","gloss":"understands"},{"surface":"ונצר","gloss":"and he who keeps","readings":["and he who keeps","and he who guards"]},{"surface":"נפשך","gloss":"your soul","readings":["your soul","your life"]},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"he"},{"surface":"ידע","gloss":"will know"},{"surface":"והשיב","gloss":"and he will return","readings":["and he will return","and he will repay"]},{"surface":"לאדם","gloss":"to a man"},{"surface":"כפעלו","gloss":"according to his work","readings":["according to his work","according to his deed"]}],"timestamp":"2026-09-20T14:14:41.561409173Z","model":"glm-5.3-flash"}